    "kicker": "B. REDUCTION CIRCUIT EQUIPMENT FUNCTION",
    "lead": "The removal of CO 2 from the recycled gas takes place in this unit, making this gas flow in counter flow with an ammine solution. Around 11% of the total process gas, which corresponds to CO 2 , entering this unit is…",
